                for i, m in ipairs(Workspace.SpeedCameras:GetChildren()) do local p = m:GetPivot().Position X.marker("tr" .. i, p, "Speed Trap · " .. math.floor((p - me).Magnitude), Color3.fromRGB(90, 200, 255)) end
            end
